---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Asturnaanta — Somwave"
  description="Sida Somwave u ilaaliso xogta aad nala wadaagto."
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6">
    <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-accent-600">Sharciga</p>
    <h1 class="mt-2 text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-ink">Siyaasadda asturnaanta</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted">
      Boggan wuxuu sharxayaa xogta aan ururinno iyo sababta. Waa nuqul kooban oo la cusboonaysiinayo
      marka adeegyadu koraan.
    </p>
    <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Xogta aan ururinno</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink">
      Foomka xiriirka, warsidaha, iyo codsiga shaqadu waxay kaydiyaan magaca, iimaylka, taleefanka
      (haddii la bixiyo), iyo fariinta. Akoonada portal-ka waxay kaydsadaan magaca, iimaylka, iyo
      xogta mashruuca/biilka ee macmiilka.
    </p>
    <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Sida loo isticmaalo</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink">
      Xogta waxaa loo isticmaalaa in lagugu jawaabo, in la maamulo mashruucyada iyo biilasha, iyo in
      la ilaaliyo nidaamka. Lama iibiyo dhinac saddexaad.
    </p>
    <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Xaqiijinta</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink">
      Haddii aad rabto inaad saxdo ama tirtirto xogtaada, nala soo xiriir.
    </p>
    <a
      href="/nala-soo-xiriir"
      class="mt-10 inline-flex h-11 items-center rounded-md bg-primary px-5 text-sm font-semibold text-surface hover:bg-primary-600"
    >
      Nala soo xiriir
    </a>
  </article>
</PageLayout>
